<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Barcelona Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 16-Cedric Pioline (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>9-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-2 7-5</p>
</text>
